  info
      - the type of the `wasi:sockets` WIT interface: `Interface in Wit at "/coaxial/sockets.wit"`
      + le type de l'interface WIT `wasi:sockets` : `Interface in Wit at
      + "/coaxial/sockets.wit"`
  detail
      - The type alias `wasiApis.wasiSocketsApi` provides, which the WASI backend's `Foreign`
